  "description": "Rocket down the steeps, throw fat whips, and earn maximum steeze points.\n\nThe Enduro is a no rules, trail, aggressive, send-it type of bike that makes the most of the mullet style setup. With a 29” x 2.5 front tire, 27.5” x 2.5 rear tire, and 160mm travel suspension fork, our Enduro setup manufactures the business in the front and party in the back.\n\nWith our solid carbon leaf-spring chainstays, our lightweight Cephal frame can tackle anything your body can handle. This is for the diehard full sender who lives life beyond the edge of traction.",
